{"speciesId":231,"names":{"fr":"Phanpy","es":"Phanpy","en":"Phanpy","ja":"ゴマゾウ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It swings its long snout around play­ fully, but because it is so strong, that can be dan­ gerous."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"As a sign of af­ fection, it bumps with its snout. However, it is so strong, it may send you flying."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"During the desert­ ed morning hours, it comes ashore where it deftly uses its trunk to take a shower."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"For its nest, PHANPY digs a vertical pit in the ground at the edge of a river. It marks the area around its nest with its trunk to let the others know that the area has been claimed."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"PHANPY uses its long nose to shower itself. When others gather around, they thoroughly douse each other with water. These POKéMON can be seen drying their soaking-wet bodies at the edge of water."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"PHANPY’s big ears serve as broad fans. When it becomes hot, it flaps the ears busily to cool down. Even the young are very strong."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"As a sign of affection, it bumps with its snout. However, it is so strong, it may send you flying."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It swings its long snout around playfully, but because it is so strong, this can be dangerous."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It swings its long snout around playfully, but because it is so strong, that can be dangerous."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"As a sign of affection, it bumps with its snout. However, it is so strong, it may send you flying."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est fort malgré son aspect ramassé. Il n’a aucun mal à porter un humain adulte sur son dos."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est fort malgré son aspect ramassé. Il n’a aucun mal à porter un humain adulte sur son dos."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se cogne sur celui ou celle qu’il apprécie. Il est cependant si fort qu’il fait souvent mal."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Como muestra de afecto, golpea con su trompa. Aunque es tan fuerte que te mandará lejos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"As a sign of affection, it bumps with its snout. However, it is so strong, it may send you flying."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"愛情表現で 鼻を ぶつけてくるが 力が あるので 気をつけないと 吹っ飛ばされる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est fort malgré son aspect ramassé. Il n’a aucun mal à porter un humain adulte sur son dos."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"A pesar de su tamaño reducido, es tan fuerte que puede llevar a un humano a su espalda con facilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体は 小さいが 力持ち。 大人の 人を 軽々と 背中に 乗せて 歩いてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pour faire son nid, Phanpy creuse un trou au bord d’une rivière. Il délimite la zone autour de son nid avec sa trompe pour prévenir les autres que ce territoire est le sien."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Phanpy cava un agujero profundo para hacer su nido en el suelo, en la ribera de los ríos, y marca con la trompa la zona para que el resto vea que ese terreno ya está ocupado."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"For its nest, Phanpy digs a vertical pit in the ground at the edge of a river. It marks the area around its nest with its trunk to let the others know that the area has been claimed."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"川の 畔に 縦穴を 掘って 暮らす。 すみかの 近くに 鼻の 印を つけて 自分の 場所だと 仲間に 教えているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Phanpy utilise sa petite trompe pour se doucher. Quand plusieurs d’entre eux se réunissent, ils s’arrosent joyeusement. On peut souvent voir ces Pokémon se sécher au bord de l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Phanpy se vale de la trompa para ducharse. Cuando varios se agrupan, se dedican a echarse agua unos a otros. Es muy fácil ver a estos Pokémon secándose cerca del agua."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Phanpy uses its long nose to shower itself. When others gather around, they thoroughly douse each other with water. These Pokémon can be seen drying their soaking-wet bodies at the edge of water."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"長い 鼻を 使って 水浴びを する。 仲間が 集まってくると 水を 掛け合う。 ずぶぬれの 体を 水辺で 乾かすよ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":231,"moves":[{"name":"slam","learns":[[8,"level-up",24],[9,"level-up",24],[10,"level-up",24],[11,"level-up",24],[14,"level-up",24],[15,"level-up",24],[16,"level-up",24],[17,"level-up",24],[18,"level-up",24],[23,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"t